{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++ code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++ code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include<bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n#define mod 1000000007\ntypedef unsigned long long int LL;\nstruct M{\n    LL s[35][35],n;\n    friend M operator * (M a,M b){\n        M c;\n        c.n=a.n;\n        int i,j,k;\n        for(i=0;i<a.n;i++){\n            for(j=0;j<a.n;j++){\n                c.s[i][j]=0;\n                for(k=0;k<a.n;k++){\n                    c.s[i][j]+=a.s[i][k]*b.s[k][j];\n                    c.s[i][j]%=mod;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return c;\n    }\n}bi[65][65],I;\nint main(){\n    LL n,m,t,x,y,z,add;\n    int i,j,k;\n    scanf(\"%llu%llu\",&n,&m);\n    bi[0][0].n=m+1;\n    for(i=0;i<=m;i++){\n        bi[0][0].s[i][i]=1;\n        bi[0][0].s[0][i]=1;\n    }\n    x=0,y=1,z=0,add=0;\n    while(y*m<=n){\n        y*=m;\n        x++;\n    }\n    for(t=0;t<=x;t++){\n        if(t){\n            bi[t][0]=bi[t-1][0];\n            for(i=1;i<m;i++){\n                bi[t][0]=bi[t][0]*bi[t-1][i];\n            }\n        }\n        for(i=1;i<m;i++){\n            bi[t][i]=bi[t][i-1];\n            for(j=m-2;j>=0;j--){\n                for(k=0;k<=m;k++){\n                    swap(bi[t][i].s[j][k],bi[t][i].s[j+1][k]);\n                }\n            }\n            for(j=m-2;j>=0;j--){\n                for(k=0;k<=m;k++){\n                    swap(bi[t][i].s[k][j],bi[t][i].s[k][j+1]);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n    }\n    for(i=0;i<=m;i++){\n        I.n=m+1;\n        I.s[i][i]=1;\n    }\n    while(add<n){\n        //printf(\"%llu\",add);\n        if(add<=n-y){\n            add+=y;\n            I=I*bi[x][z];\n            z=(z+1)%m;\n        }\n        else{\n            y/=m;\n            x--;\n        }\n    }\n    //I.pt();\n    LL ans=0;\n    for(i=0;i<=m;i++){\n        ans=(ans+I.s[i][m])%mod;\n    }\n    printf(\"%llu\\n\",ans);\n}\n\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final long MOD = 1000000007;\n    \n    static class Matrix {\n        long[][] s;\n        int n;\n        \n        Matrix(int size) {\n            n = size;\n            s = new long[size][size];\n        }\n        \n        Matrix(int size, boolean identity) {\n            n = size;\n            s = new long[size][size];\n            if (identity) {\n                for (int i = 0; i < size; i++) {\n                    s[i][i] = 1;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        static Matrix multiply(Matrix a, Matrix b) {\n            Matrix c = new Matrix(a.n);\n            c.n = a.n;\n            for (int i = 0; i < a.n; i++) {\n                for (int j = 0; j < a.n; j++) {\n                    c.s[i][j] = 0;\n                    for (int k = 0; k < a.n; k++) {\n                        c.s[i][j] += a.s[i][k] * b.s[k][j];\n                        c.s[i][j] %= MOD;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            return c;\n        }\n        \n        void swapRows(int row1, int row2) {\n            for (int col = 0; col < n; col++) {\n                long temp = s[row1][col];\n                s[row1][col] = s[row2][col];\n                s[row2][col] = temp;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        void swapCols(int col1, int col2) {\n            for (int row = 0; row < n; row++) {\n                long temp = s[row][col1];\n                s[row][col1] = s[row][col2];\n                s[row][col2] = temp;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n        long m = sc.nextLong();\n        \n        Matrix[][] bi = new Matrix[65][65];\n        for (int i = 0; i < 65; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < 65; j++) {\n                bi[i][j] = null;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        Matrix I = null;\n        \n        long x = 0, y = 1, z = 0, add = 0;\n        int i, j, k;\n        \n        bi[0][0] = new Matrix((int)(m + 1));\n        for (i = 0; i <= m; i++) {\n            bi[0][0].s[i][i] = 1;\n            bi[0][0].s[0][i] = 1;\n        }\n        \n        while (y * m <= n) {\n            y *= m;\n            x++;\n        }\n        \n        for (int t = 0; t <= x; t++) {\n            if (t != 0) {\n                bi[t][0] = new Matrix(bi[t-1][0].n);\n                bi[t][0].s = deepCopy(bi[t-1][0].s, bi[t-1][0].n);\n                for (i = 1; i < m; i++) {\n                    bi[t][0] = Matrix.multiply(bi[t][0], bi[t-1][i]);\n                }\n            }\n            for (i = 1; i < m; i++) {\n                bi[t][i] = new Matrix(bi[t][i-1].n);\n                bi[t][i].s = deepCopy(bi[t][i-1].s, bi[t][i-1].n);\n                \n                for (j = (int)m - 2; j >= 0; j--) {\n                    for (k = 0; k <= m; k++) {\n                        long temp = bi[t][i].s[j][k];\n                        bi[t][i].s[j][k] = bi[t][i].s[j+1][k];\n                        bi[t][i].s[j+1][k] = temp;\n                    }\n                }\n                \n                for (j = (int)m - 2; j >= 0; j--) {\n                    for (k = 0; k <= m; k++) {\n                        long temp = bi[t][i].s[k][j];\n                        bi[t][i].s[k][j] = bi[t][i].s[k][j+1];\n                        bi[t][i].s[k][j+1] = temp;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        I = new Matrix((int)(m + 1), true);\n        \n        while (add < n) {\n            if (add <= n - y) {\n                add += y;\n                I = Matrix.multiply(I, bi[(int)x][(int)z]);\n                z = (z + 1) % m;\n            } else {\n                y /= m;\n                x--;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        long ans = 0;\n        for (i = 0; i <= m; i++) {\n            ans = (ans + I.s[i][(int)m]) % MOD;\n        }\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n    \n    private static long[][] deepCopy(long[][] src, int size) {\n        long[][] dest = new long[size][size];\n        for (int i = 0; i < size; i++) {\n            System.arraycopy(src[i], 0, dest[i], 0, size);\n        }\n        return dest;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.85\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00012563870404846966, -2.622600959512056e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -9.798523387871683e-05, -1.7404405298293568e-05, -0.012632117606699467, -0.21149347722530365, -0.00012420836719684303, -4.768370445162873e-07, -7.676783570786938e-05, -0.02054411917924881, -5.483612312673358e-06, -0.0019239740213379264, -0.0001227780303452164, -0.0003583981015253812, -0.020571796223521233, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -5.149708886165172e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -2.0265558760002023e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.5837191939353943, -0.08894436061382294, -3.576278118089249e-07, -4.410734163684538e-06, -3.576272320060525e-06, -0.0002302858338225633, -7.033323527139146e-06, -7.152555099310121e-07, -9.894321920000948e-06, -2.861018856492592e-06, -5.960462